    51	The bearing's country; the Hall's water and stone; the fight's moment-to-moment inside the taught rule; the marsh's two days; Teague's manner beside the fire; the walk's last mild days [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit A2]; the crest at dusk; the road home into snow; the inn by lamp; every window.
