    53	## Where we leave pressure
    54	
    55	Book 8 Ch1: Lowmarch with the ice coming and the ferry's ropes taken in. Ninety-six in hand. A kit on a table. A map with a line going off its edge. A healer at Thornwater with a route and an arm to release. A captain's after-thaw term. [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit A2] A fourth circle twice the size behind a fence of iron. And a question asked once at a table that nobody answered.
